<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Properties.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boston Properties.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sach said it initiated coverage of Boston Properties Inc and added it to the recommended list.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Boston Properties gained 7/16 to 26-7/8.</p>
